==As a quest objective==
* {{questlong|Alliance|32|Defying Orders}}

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
[[Ambershire]] is normally heavily guarded, but the Jousting Tournament and recent attacks by the orcs and Dark Iron present a ripe opportunity for us. This is our moment to strike!
----
Use the cover of the night to ascertain the situation and learn the guard's patrols. Once you memorize them and ONLY then, return to our base up at [[Crystal Falls]] to the southeast, and make sure not to get caught by the folk from the inn at [[Grimmen Lake]]!
}}

